{"id":35125,"date":"2025-09-23T11:38:56","date_gmt":"2025-09-23T11:38:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bakirkoymurategitim.com.tr\/?page_id=35125"},"modified":"2026-08-20T11:05:28","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T11:05:28","slug":"egitim-felsefemiz-ozgun-mentorluk-gaziosmanpasa-murat-egitim","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/egitim-felsefemiz-ozgun-mentorluk-gaziosmanpasa-murat-egitim\/","title":{"rendered":"E\u011fitim Felsefemiz"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"35125\" class=\"elementor elementor-35125\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49e5448 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"49e5448\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-096dabe e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"096dabe\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-251a86e e-con-full animated-slow e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"251a86e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;ekit--slide-up&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5873e76 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5873e76\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>E\u011fitim Felsefemiz<\/h1><p>Murat E\u011fitim Kurumlar\u0131 Gaziosmanpa\u015fa \u015eubesi, 1983 y\u0131l\u0131nda \u0130stanbul&#8217;un k\u00fclt\u00fcrel ve akademik a\u00e7\u0131dan zengin b\u00f6lgelerinden biri olan Gaziosmanpa\u015fa&#8217;da e\u011fitim hayat\u0131na ba\u015flam\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Kurumumuz, e\u011fitimde m\u00fckemmeliyet\u00e7i bir yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 benimseyen, bilimsel temellere dayanan pedagojik metodolojiler uygulayan ve her \u00f6\u011frencinin bireysel \u00f6\u011frenme potansiyelini maksimize etmeyi hedefleyen bir e\u011fitim kurumudur.<\/p><h2>Tarih\u00e7emiz ve Geli\u015fim S\u00fcrecimiz<\/h2><p>Kurulu\u015fumuzdan bu yana ge\u00e7en s\u00fcre i\u00e7erisinde, e\u011fitim alan\u0131ndaki en g\u00fcncel bilimsel yakla\u015f\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek, m\u00fcfredat\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 ve e\u011fitim metodolojilerimizi s\u00fcrekli olarak g\u00fcncellemekteyiz. Gaziosmanpa\u015fa&#8217;da ba\u015flayan e\u011fitim yolculu\u011fumuz, bug\u00fcn b\u00f6lgenin en prestijli ve tercih edilen e\u011fitim kurumlar\u0131ndan biri haline gelmi\u015ftir.<\/p><h2>Akademik Kadromuz<\/h2><p>Kurumumuzun en de\u011ferli varl\u0131klar\u0131ndan biri olan \u00f6\u011fretim kadromuz, T\u00fcrkiye&#8217;nin \u00f6nde gelen \u00fcniversitelerinden mezun, alanlar\u0131nda uzmanla\u015fm\u0131\u015f ve s\u00fcrekli mesleki geli\u015fim i\u00e7erisinde olan e\u011fitimcilerden olu\u015fmaktad\u0131r. Akademik personelimizin \u00e7o\u011funlu\u011fu ulusal \u00f6l\u00e7ekte tan\u0131nan yay\u0131nevlerine ders materyalleri ve akademik i\u00e7erikler haz\u0131rlamakta, b\u00f6ylece g\u00fcncel e\u011fitim literat\u00fcr\u00fcne katk\u0131da bulunmaktad\u0131r.<\/p><p>\u00d6\u011fretmenlerimiz, sadece akademik bilgi aktar\u0131m\u0131 ile s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 kalmay\u0131p, \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin analitik d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnme, problem \u00e7\u00f6zme, ele\u015ftirel sorgulama ve yarat\u0131c\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnme becerilerini geli\u015ftirmeye odaklanmaktad\u0131r. Bu ba\u011flamda, her bir e\u011fitimcimiz, kendi alan\u0131nda \u00f6\u011frencilere rehberlik eden bir mentor olarak konumland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.<\/p><h2>Benzersiz Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck Sistemimiz<\/h2><p>Murat E\u011fitim Kurumlar\u0131 Gaziosmanpa\u015fa \u015eubesi&#8217;ni di\u011fer e\u011fitim kurumlar\u0131ndan ay\u0131ran en \u00f6nemli \u00f6zelliklerden biri, \u00fclkemizde benzeri bulunmayan \u00f6zg\u00fcn <strong>Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck Sistemi<\/strong>&#8216;dir. Bu sistem, Psikolojik Dan\u0131\u015fmanl\u0131k ve Rehberlik (PDR) uzmanlar\u0131 ile klinik psikologlar taraf\u0131ndan bilimsel veriler \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131nda tasarlanm\u0131\u015f olup, her \u00f6\u011frencinin bili\u015fsel, duygusal ve sosyal geli\u015fimini b\u00fct\u00fcnc\u00fcl bir yakla\u015f\u0131mla desteklemektedir.<\/p><p>Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck Sistemimiz, \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin:<\/p><ul><li>Akademik hedeflerini belirlemelerine ve bu hedeflere ula\u015fmak i\u00e7in stratejik planlama yapmalar\u0131na<\/li><li>Ki\u015fisel \u00f6\u011frenme stillerini ke\u015ffetmelerine ve bu do\u011frultuda verimli \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma metodlar\u0131 geli\u015ftirmelerine<\/li><li>Zaman y\u00f6netimi ve \u00f6z-disiplin becerilerini g\u00fc\u00e7lendirmelerine<\/li><li>S\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131 ve akademik stresle ba\u015fa \u00e7\u0131kma mekanizmalar\u0131 geli\u015ftirmelerine<\/li><li>Uzun vadeli kariyer planlamas\u0131 yapmalar\u0131na<\/li><\/ul><p>yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmaktad\u0131r. Bu sistem, her akademik y\u0131l ba\u015f\u0131nda uzman ekibimiz taraf\u0131ndan g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irilmekte, \u00f6\u011frenci geri bildirimleri ve g\u00fcncel e\u011fitim ara\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 do\u011frultusunda s\u00fcrekli olarak iyile\u015ftirilmektedir.<\/p><h2>E\u011fitim Felsefemiz ve De\u011ferlerimiz<\/h2><p>Gaziosmanpa\u015fa Murat E\u011fitim Kurumlar\u0131 olarak e\u011fitim felsefemiz, her \u00f6\u011frencinin kendine \u00f6zg\u00fc bir birey oldu\u011fu anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131na dayanmaktad\u0131r. Bu do\u011frultuda, standardize edilmi\u015f bir e\u011fitim yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 yerine, \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin bireysel \u00f6\u011frenme ihtiya\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131, g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc y\u00f6nlerini ve geli\u015ftirmeye a\u00e7\u0131k alanlar\u0131n\u0131 dikkate alan ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirilmi\u015f e\u011fitim programlar\u0131 sunmaktay\u0131z.<\/p><p>Kurumsal de\u011ferlerimiz aras\u0131nda:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Akademik M\u00fckemmellik:<\/strong> \u00d6\u011frencilerimizin akademik potansiyellerini en \u00fcst d\u00fczeyde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirmelerini sa\u011flamak<\/li><li><strong>B\u00fct\u00fcnsel Geli\u015fim:<\/strong> Akademik ba\u015far\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131 s\u0131ra sosyal, duygusal ve etik geli\u015fimi desteklemek<\/li><li><strong>Ele\u015ftirel D\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnme:<\/strong> Sorgulayan, ara\u015ft\u0131ran ve analitik d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnebilen bireyler yeti\u015ftirmek<\/li><li><strong>\u0130novasyon:<\/strong> E\u011fitimde yenilik\u00e7i yakla\u015f\u0131mlar\u0131 benimsemek ve uygulamak<\/li><li><strong>Toplumsal Sorumluluk:<\/strong> Topluma de\u011fer katan, etik de\u011ferlere sahip bireyler yeti\u015ftirmek<\/li><\/ul><p>yer almaktad\u0131r.<\/p><h2>Misyonumuz ve Vizyonumuz<\/h2><p><strong>Misyonumuz:<\/strong> \u00d6\u011frencilerimizin g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc y\u00f6nlerini ke\u015ffedip potansiyellerini en \u00fcst d\u00fczeye \u00e7\u0131kararak, onlar\u0131 akademik m\u00fckemmelli\u011fe ula\u015ft\u0131rmak ve ya\u015fam boyu \u00f6\u011frenmeyi benimseyen, topluma katk\u0131 sa\u011flayan bireyler yeti\u015ftirmektir.<\/p><p><strong>Vizyonumuz:<\/strong> E\u011fitimde yenilik\u00e7i yakla\u015f\u0131mlarla fark yaratan, \u00f6\u011frenci merkezli e\u011fitim anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131yla T\u00fcrkiye&#8217;nin \u00f6nde gelen e\u011fitim kurumlar\u0131 aras\u0131nda yer almakt\u0131r.<\/p><p><!-- notionvc: 3b54f897-684c-4c83-be7d-54cd1573317c --><\/p><p><!-- notionvc: f06fd33f-ee2e-4dc1-8e7b-9b5e9dc8cbb2 --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec98658 e-con-full animated-slow e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ec98658\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"conta